                    \\,.
            %p
              By the standard construction of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Atiyah-Hirzebruch+spectral+sequence"} Atiyah-Hirzebruch spectral sequence
              (
              %a{:href => "Atiyah&#8211;Hirzebruch+spectral+sequence#ConstructionByFilteringTheBaseSpace"}> here
              ) in this identification the element
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi c
                      %mn 1
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} c_1
              is identified with a generator of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/relative+cohomology"} relative cohomology
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
